/* THE ARCADE's native engines (features/arcade): DOOM's and Quake's pictures at 4:3 at the top while the phone is
   upright, the controls below as a DOS game's; sideways, DOOM stays 4:3 in the middle and Quake fills the screen. A
   finished level's tally with Ghosty's line over the game for a few seconds; PAUSE's one small frame-rate line. While a
   game plays, the app's own 3-D scene behind the player is not drawn at the screen's size (it sizes itself to its
   canvas, here none): measured, DOOM in the preview went from 9–15 fps to 20–33 with it out of the way. */
html.arcplaying #gl { display: none; }
html .arcscreen.doom, html .arcscreen.quake { width: 100vw; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; max-height: 62dvh; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); max-width: calc(62dvh * 4 / 3); }
