/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   THE SCAN'S HOME (BRIEF-HUD-SCAN-1; features/core/scan): the whole of it with the room inside, drawn in Home's one context
   behind the Machine's marks. Every colour, size and duration is a token; the marks are THE SYSTEM's own. On while THE LOOK's
   world is The Scan and Home is on screen (body.scanhome); the other looks keep today's Home untouched.
   --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
html .scanframe { display: none; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none; background: var(--g-room-canvas); color: var(--g-ink-1); isolation: isolate; }
