/* ==========================================================================================================================
   THE STAGE (BRIEF-SHOW-ME-1; show/stage.ts): what the answer is about, brought up and shown. A plate brought to the front, in the
   world's own drawing (the plate tokens: Glass is glass, The Scan a plate, ONE INK two rules), docked above the ask line, with the
