/* ---------------------------------------------------------------- THE WORKSPACE: pages, databases and their five views (BRIEF-EDITOR-WORKSPACE)
   Drawn in the world's own plate and ink; every key and every row is 44 pt; a board, a calendar and a timeline scroll inside their own box, never the
   page sideways. A page's mark is one of the house's thin-line marks. Nothing here is a raw colour: only the system's tokens. */
.wssheet { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: hidden; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; padding: var(--g-s-2); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--g-s-1); }
